  description: '"Eldlich the Golden Lord" + 1 Zombie monster

    Must be either
    Fusion Summoned, or Special Summoned (from your Extra Deck) by Tributing 1 LIGHT
    Zombie monster, while you have "Eldlich the Golden Lord" in your field or GY.
    You can only Special Summon "Fallen Angel of the Golden Land" once per turn this
    way, no matter which method you use. If this card is sent from the field to the
    GY: You can Special Summon 1 "Eldlich" monster from your Deck, Extra Deck, or
    GY. You can only use this effect of "Fallen Angel of the Golden Land" once per
    turn.'
